==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-reverse sweep.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|cricket}} A [[batsman]]'s [[shot]] made by [[swinging]] the [[bat]] in a [[horizontal]] [[arc]] from [[leg]] to [[off]], normally whilst [[kneeling]].
# {{lb|en|sport}} The act of winning a [[match]] after losing every [[set]] up to the maximum number where, should you lose one more set, you would instead lose the match.

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|switch hit}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|reverse sweep<,,swept>}}

# {{lb|en|cricket}} To play such a shot.
# {{lb|en|sport}} To win such a match.